## 🔁 Integration Tip

You can even wrap it in a higher-level function like:

```c
void read_adc_board(SPI_HandleTypeDef *hspi, const char *adc_label)
{
    uint8_t rx_buf[24];
    int32_t ch_values[8];

    ADS131_Read(hspi, rx_buf);
    decode_all_channels(rx_buf, ch_values);

    for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++)
    {
        char msg[64];
        snprintf(msg, sizeof(msg), "%s_CH%d: %ld\r\n", adc_label, i + 1, ch_values[i]);
        print_uart(msg);
    }
}
```

Usage:

```c
read_adc_board(&hspi1, "ADC1");
read_adc_board(&hspi2, "ADC2");
```

